{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>I had not pllt.</b> A term of prayer, like <b>ויעמוד פנחס ויפלל</b>. I had not prayed to see your face, for I said, 'Joseph is surely torn.' Another interpretation: I had not judged in my heart. Every <i>plul</i> is a term of judgment."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:01.926696053Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}